pkg:Evidence_v1_41_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.41.0 (real Build-stage fix from owner log; RegisterSession addressed)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: investigated an owner-uploaded real session log showing agentCodeGen/agentTestGen both refusing with 'no code block found in response'. Read the raw captured model output directly: the retry attempt was paraphrasing the combined remedy text back as rambling prose rather than writing corrected code. Root-caused to the one flagged-result branch in the whole file with no remedy field; added a specific, actionable one. Verified via real Playwright and the full 24-question regression suite, 24/24 passing, 0 errors. A real new BRSF requirement (RegisterSession) was addressed honestly with a real session record. Re-confirmed both prior WSJF scores, correctly flagged stale by a new completion; one real mistake (an accidental line deletion during that edit) caught and fixed immediately by re-reading the result. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS, register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "639d25ddf31097cf853fca4e65980e2845e51b9ae52ac2f6b4c62c933c715c77"^^xsd:string .
